      "comment": "MAGIC MANIA (4) got around 440m in a slick 24.83 when winning a Grade 5 at this track last start. In form and looks the one to beat again. PRETTY BOY FLOYD (1) jumped from a middle draw last time and could manage only fourth and beaten 4.5 lengths (30.10) at Wentworth Park. Form here at the trip excellent including six wins. Comes through a solid form race last start. Bold showing expected. CANYA CONVICT (5) impressed when clocking a lightning 29.34 over 520m at Nowra three back then has hit the frame in both runs since. Has the ability and looks a key chance. MAGIC FLETCH (7) warrants respect with the drop in trip.",
